            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. A unit member who is requested by an appropriate official to report back to work after the unit member's normal workday or to report to work on a nonscheduled workday shall be credited with a minimum of three (3) hours of work. However, time worked immediately before or immediately after the unit member's regularly scheduled hours is not considered callback work and only the actual work time is reported.",
            "block_bbox": [
